{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_04",
  "title": "Let the Old Times Go",
  "storyCode": "WB-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a03dc6578b4f65fa6244b13bbbf1fe27b49e2032870a0662c8e062c70f31df41",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Innkeeper",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who was that man? He just came in, looked around, and left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inn Assistant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could be a plainclothes from the Patrol Battalion, coming to see if there are smugglers here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Innkeeper",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Plainclothes won't bumble like that or draw so much attention."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inn Assistant",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then he came to cause trouble. I'll go and catch him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Innkeeper",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How? He was gone in the blink of an eye. He clearly knows qinggong."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Burly Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That was the last inn. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Burly Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The girl said she wanted to leave the city, but she's not at the gates."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Burly Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The doc had to use the best meds to treat her. What if she doesn't come back, and he puts the bill on my tab?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Burly Man",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have to catch her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure I understand your analogy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah, it wasn't the most apt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I opened my little agency in Lungmen to make a living, but business ended up better than I expected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wei Yenwu and the L.G.D. can't deal with every little trouble out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need good citizens like Mr. Lin to pitch in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It can't be helped."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can't be helped... that's true for Lungmen, and it's true for Yumen as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yumen patrols the northern borders to repel potential threats to Yan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Back when Originium technology was not so advanced, it took several times the manpower to run a mobile fortress like Yumen, compared to today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A group of patriotic martial artists went to Yumen at the time. They never officially joined the army, but they helped out with all sorts of things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Escorting Messengers, scouting the path ahead, even going into battle with the army... they played a key role in Yumen's peace and prosperity, and earned the respect of the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The court and jianghu were of one mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This was how Yumen used to be... until twenty years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Shanhaizhong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. Once again, the Shanhaizhong were the reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's nothing else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I hope I didn't bother you in your duties. It would be on my head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You knew I wouldn't agree."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A short whistle, then the tower's Originium lighting shuts off without warning, surrounding the pair in darkness."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A flickering flame lights up in the distance a second later.\nThe soldiers run back and forth, passing the torch between the beacons.\nSeventeen roars of the drum, dragged through the night sky by the rapidly moving Yumen."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Today is the second day of the Wangfeng Festival."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It was created to remind the people of Yumen to remember the past."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This meeting may have taken place earlier, or later."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By then, you may have recalled a few things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've never forgotten."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you remember how many of the heroes who died for Yumen were not soldiers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They owe Yumen nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nor does Yumen owe anyone anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Zuo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patrol Battalion Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stand down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It was my negligence that allowed those criminals into the city twenty years ago, disguised as Yumen martial artists. You can blame me, punish me, execute me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the blame should fall only on me—or on you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All the responsibility falls upon me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And how have you taken responsibility? Alienating the brothers who gave blood and sweat for Yumen, driving them away—is that your idea of taking responsibility?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yumen owes them an answer!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yumen belongs to Yan. All it does is in the service of the Yanese people. That's my answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Xuanliao",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This meeting is over."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The name 'Shanhaizhong' is not widely known."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It wasn't that anyone was negligent. Everyone was so focused on guarding against external threats, they didn't realize there were enemies hiding in the shadows."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bodyguards, bouncers, blacksmiths... these civilians often fought alongside the soldiers, and enjoyed a great deal of freedom in Yumen. The Shanhaizhong took advantage of this fact."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The city was caught off-guard and responded slowly. The Shanhaizhong's plot to destroy the city's power core was foiled, but only after heavy casualties had been taken."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Taking measures after the fact is still better than not at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the measures might have gone too far."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After that, the Lord Exorcist began to reform the city's administration, removing jianghu involvement, and setting increased restrictions on the movement of people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Some of those who stayed joined the army. Others put their swords down and took up another living. An ordinary cook at an inn may have been a famous swordsman, back in the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Twenty years is plenty of time for a city to look very different."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dad always says that there will come a day when Lungmen won't need downtown or the Rat King anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If there comes a day when this city no longer needs to patrol the barrenlands, then the people in the city won't need to carry swords anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Times change. Some want to give it a push, others a pull. In the end, they're all left behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lee",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's the story that I heard. Does it help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A lot, actually."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Lee."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What did you learn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yumen Martial Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ten-man, two-hour shifts. No extra guards at the sand sluice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just as I saw."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "One more thing to ask you to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At the Hour of Yu, I want you to cause a little commotion around the sand sluice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing too big, just draw away the patrols."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yumen Martial Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ask no questions, if you still trust me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yumen Martial Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yumen Martial Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you see Zuo Xuanliao on the tower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, I did."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's getting hotter..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Someone attacked Wei Yenwu last night and threw the Yumen barracks into chaos. You were the assassin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You cause abnormal weather wherever you go. Is this Arts? Or some other trick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Le",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Murder of a Messenger, attempted theft of Catastrophe data, attempted assassination of a court official."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Le",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you think Yumen is, Shanhaizhong?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A city headed the wrong way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This way is wrong. Go no further."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Le",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know why Yumen is returning..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not hard to guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Le",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Father tasked me to complete three tasks in three days: recover the Grandmaster's sword, catch the assassin, and track down the Shanhaizhong who have infiltrated the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Zuo Le",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It turns out all the answers were right here in the Sword Forge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You won't complete any of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stand back. This one's kung fu is unfathomable. We're no match for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're not as strong as the Forte man, but you seem a little quicker on the uptake."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So it was you who attacked Lord Taihe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You dodged the last strike. Will you dodge or block the next one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Qiubai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Neither.\nHe often told her that kung fu is like climbing a mountain, whether as a tool of revenge, or a way of life. The more treacherous the path, the steadier one's heart must be.\nShe saw her enemy, and she saw the mountain. That is why she spent five years with him.\nIf the battle cannot be won, she would seek to not lose."
