      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get out of the way, Zuo Le!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Qiubai grabs Zuo Le by the collar and pulls him back.\nHe sees the foe's third swing, which lights up the yard.\nIt is March, but the Sword Forge feels like it is mid-summer. Even the night sky looks a little whiter in the heat wave.\nThere is only a pagoda tree behind them. There is nowhere to run."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
